Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "jaderito",
  "email": "jaderito@example.com",
  "password": "1234567890",
  "roleIds": [7]
}


###

### Actualizar usuario o roles
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "roleIds": [{{roleId}}]
}

###

### Desactivar usuario
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
